  "content": "<h1><strong>Keerdm的殭屍末日必需品</strong></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_737e5d99-63b4-4dcb-bc66-d0236240fd81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"2\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkeerdm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e1176f98-5369-4e03-82b3-c78a7931710c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"138\"></span></a></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_11a36afe-b55c-474a-ab88-d6a844121e5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"2\"></p>\n<h2><strong>說明</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e5481172-ddee-46b4-820b-de6c45e7b637.png\"></p>\n<p>（說明中唯一必要的部分是按下「自訂」，然後將世界風格從「標準」更改為 keerdm_zombie_essentials:testworld。）</p>\n<h3><strong>若要顯示圖庫圖片中的結果，請選擇 talluildings 預設值。</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>在留言或提出任何問題之前，請閱讀完整描述！</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>如果您安裝了此模組且未遵循說明，請勿在 LOST CITIES 的 GitHub 上提交問題！</strong></span></h1>\n<p>這個模組<strong>完美</strong>適合喜歡<strong>殭屍末日整合包</strong>的玩家。它修改了<strong>The Lost Cities</strong>中的建築，賦予它們<strong>後末日</strong>的外觀。</p>\n<p><strong>歡迎在評論中留下任何建議或問題！（：</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>功能：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>修改過的城市</strong>，提供後末日體驗</li>\n<li><strong>廢棄的電力線</strong></li>\n<li>更好的<strong>小屋</strong></li>\n<li>增強版的<strong>電台塔</strong></li>\n<li>高速公路設有<strong>廢棄汽車</strong></li>\n<li>景觀中散佈著<strong>風力渦輪機</strong></li>\n<li>城市戰利品箱中有<strong>可拾取的槍支和彈藥</strong>（<strong>選配</strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>此模組需要：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Immersive Weathering</strong></li>\n<li><strong>The Lost Cities</strong></li>\n<li>選配：<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong>、<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong> 或 <strong>Timeless and Classics TAC</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>從<strong>v1.1（含 TACZ）</strong>或<strong>v1.2（含 Vic's Point Blank）</strong>開始，<strong>槍支和彈藥</strong>將生成在城市戰利品箱中，增加沉浸感。</p>\n<h3><strong>v1.4 新增功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高速公路現在設有廢棄汽車</strong></li>\n<li><strong>風力渦輪機</strong>已添加到景觀中</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>槍械模組支援：</strong></h3>\n<p>v1.2 之後的版本將包含兩個獨立版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一個支援<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong></li>\n<li>一個支援<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>相容性：</strong></h2>\n<table style=\"width:70.516%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">版本</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.20.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(23